        "It was a winter night and it was raining on the empty restaurant. Suddenly a man came in with a huge wet dog. I had never seen such a big animal. \"Do you have a table for two?\" he asked me. Mateo, who is from Argentina, told him: \"You sit down, I'll bring you a soup.\" I, on the other hand, addressed him as usted until he said: \"Call me tú, please.\" That night we made a dinner for the two of them, and it was a huge hit. Since then we have been friends and we call each other tú.",
